### AutoMapper tip for abstract TDto
Configure includes once, e.g.:
```csharp
// Base
CreateMap<TModelBase, TDtoBase>()
    .Include<ModelA, DtoA>()
    .Include<ModelB, DtoB>();

// Derived
CreateMap<ModelA, DtoA>();
CreateMap<ModelB, DtoB>();
```
Then `Map<List<TDtoBase>>(models)` will produce the correct derived DTO instances.

